Description: Datasets and tools for cardiovascular research data. Queries the
    FDA MAUDE database of medical device adverse event reports through
    'openFDA', resolves its free-text manufacturer and brand strings onto
    companies and ablation platforms, and groups its coded problem terms into
    clinical complications. Extracts measurements from echocardiogram report
    text, looks up procedural billing codes, reads variant annotations, and
    fits cosinor models of circadian rhythm.
